# The per-fact TTL override. `Short` is `scope ttl 1_h`; `with_override` emits
# it with `retain: 5_min`, `without_override` plain. The override needs
# `dynamic_ttl` ([LDTL.3.2]) and a `ttl` schema ([LDTL.4.1]). Advancing 5
# minutes and a nanosecond sweeps the overridden fact and leaves the plain
# one.
assert Trig v=1
pump
advance 300000000001
pump
